      "rationale": "This simplification adds the constructor-disjointness fact that a one-element IntSeq is not empty. Stage 1 proves the same fact in the lemma-only definition, but prove.sh compiles and uses this rule in the main proof before running that separate proof, so it does not satisfy the required first-proved ordering for PROVED_DERIVED_LEMMA."
